quick TL:DR
I am sharing this as public to make only the code usable for others, you cannot use any visuals or proggression from this without permission.

This is intended so that anyone who wants/needs to can see and read how it comes together, and to also have peace in mind that it is not a virus.

You cannot use everything from this project as stated before like the visuals, but I do not and will not allow anyone to use my models or assets without permission. To use any model, gameplay/method of progressing, or textures you must request permission and can only use it without issues by my voice in saying yes.

If you want to use any part of this project in any way, please let me know, I can provide files and non financial support in whatever you'd like to do.